      "en": "I predestine you to die by the sword,[NOTE:1] all of you will kneel down at the slaughtering block,[NOTE:2] because I called to you, and you did not respond;I spoke and you did not listen.You did evil before me;[NOTE:3] you chose to do what displeases me.”",
