      "en": "No longer will they build a house only to have another live in it,[NOTE:1] or plant a vineyard only to have another eat its fruit,[NOTE:2] for my people will live as long as trees,[NOTE:3] and my chosen ones will enjoy to the fullest what they have produced.[NOTE:4]",
